 "intro_zh": "这个城镇位于瓦尔塔瓦河(Vltava river)畔，围绕一座13世纪城堡而建。这座城堡融合了哥特式、文艺复兴式以及巴洛克式风格。这是中世纪中欧小城的杰出典范，经历五个多世纪的和平发展，其建筑古迹被原封不动地保留了下来。",
 "intro_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_en": "Situated on the banks of the Vltava river, the town was built around a 13th-century castle with Gothic, Renaissance and Baroque elements. It is an outstanding example of a small central European medieval town whose architectural heritage has remained intact thanks to its peaceful evolution over more than five centuries.",
 "intro_en_source": "unesco_official",
